# Line endings.
#
# The repository stores LF. Most files may be checked out however the platform
# prefers, but three kinds of file are matched **byte for byte** and must not be
# rewritten on checkout:
#
#  - `docs/research/**` — the extracted manual. Every question's citation is
#    validated as a verbatim substring of it, and the line-spanning quote rule
#    in `executable-floor.md` §3 asserts on a literal `\n`. A Windows checkout
#    with `core.autocrlf=true` turns those into `\r\n` and `npm test` fails on a
#    machine where nothing is actually wrong.
#  - `src/content/**` — the generated content bundle, compared against the same
#    source.
#  - `public/fonts/**` and other binaries — never touched at all.
docs/research/** text eol=lf
src/content/** text eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
